## Verdict

**PASS WITH WARNINGS**

The agent is structurally complete: all 5 specified files exist, the script is syntactically valid, dependencies resolve, a commit with the changes exists and has been pushed, and 19 of 22 spec scenarios are compliant. The 3 non-compliant scenarios are either design-level tradeoffs (RestartSec override, 5xx retry omission) or a partially-implemented interactive install path that the install script flags-as-error rather than prompting. No critical defect blocks deployment — the agent run against the docker backend successfully collected and POSTed metrics, confirming the end-to-end data path works.

